{
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       sensor.bio.pulse-ox.max30102.spin2
    Description:    Driver for the MAX30102 pulse-oximeter/heart-rate sensor
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Jul 2, 2020
